#: search:search_D216F5A2_90FB_432B_8641_E77B5EBFC230
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43d9bf53a028f2ee6d5b8ded7e4232fcd70a7e0c34109462733e909a3a6da728
#. default-sha256: 727f0eb6b71e5ac14250ea3f0a73456a8b3252d7a1070b9a68603ace97bdba04
msgctxt "search:search_D216F5A2_90FB_432B_8641_E77B5EBFC230"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Oh, there you are, Master. ⟪k:5⟫You gave me quite the scare.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"After returning from the third door, you disappeared without a word."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ah, aí está você, Mestre. ⟪k:5⟫Você me deu um susto.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Depois de "
"voltar da terceira porta, você desapareceu sem dizer uma palavra."

#: search:search_76472D0C_19F0_45BD_95FE_38AFC767ED36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5454ad193b1832ca930748d48953ec71d38c8f3ec24206f58cb808be686ba1e6
#. default-sha256: 8348740eb1eb09174612ce1979346853fbc2b43743d6344a84e4e0f2fac32d36
msgctxt "search:search_76472D0C_19F0_45BD_95FE_38AFC767ED36"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It was you who disappeared..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Foi você quem desapareceu..."

#: search:search_3F44A27A_5E4B_498F_81C9_43A353E7CFEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a4d142a1b97381553720846bca8722a2bc07bde0e8886f508ece6ea769b1d66
#. default-sha256: ab4dc67b1e538323b9a94599ec434e2db5af8029330f0205d1f7f276e339132b
msgctxt "search:search_3F44A27A_5E4B_498F_81C9_43A353E7CFEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh my... ⟪k:3⟫It was ⟪k:4⟫I⟪k:5⟫ who disappeared?⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫That is quite strange. "
"I did not go anywhere, as far as I am aware."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ó céus...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Fui ⟪k:5⟫eu⟪k:6⟫ que desapareci?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Isso é bem estranho. "
"Não fui a lugar nenhum, até onde sei."

#: search:search_E2712B82_695C_4D54_A63F_254D4F55FE9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f3ade687976cab630d8fddeedc131e88ae830e8941a9003555a2544d3ee8266
#. default-sha256: 089e7b8dcd3f8d8a8c5c776452d0e5cbbc22dcac530e40daff4557e24c2c3fc5
msgctxt "search:search_E2712B82_695C_4D54_A63F_254D4F55FE9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nevertheless, I am glad to have found you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I would have been at a complete "
"loss for what to do⟪k:4⟫if I had been separated from you yet again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Independentemente disso, estou feliz por ter encontrado você.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Eu teria ficado "
"completamente perdida se eu tivesse sido separada de você mais uma vez."

