msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você disse... ⟪k:1⟫que estava esperando por mim..."

#: search:search_B320244E_8E13_4AA2_8770_DAFE48335C47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88b49ee642747ae3c805da3e4b4fdc05380e38be6b7057c4153fcb0166cada58
