msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I did, indeed, say that when you first arrived.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have been waiting for "
"your return for a very long time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu, de fato, disse isso quando você chegou.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tenho esperando seu retorno "
"há muito tempo."

#: search:search_3559D7AC_CF00_3609_7196_1CA18989ADC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 388fd4ea4dd84388f010fb6923bf0e49eda7e6c837151d97e3d980d1557b468b
