#: search:search_E72785FD_5854_43DD_B8DA_45D0F2A1512F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdd7d231921ee7b80ef8ca1b9bd0b5fa5e25614d6bca9b1942d8cd5034f5e9f5
