msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe... ⟪k:3⟫I am very much not a ghost.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Would I be able to hold your "
"hand if I were?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe... ⟪k:3⟫Eu não sou um fantasma.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Eu seria capaz de segurar sua mão "
"se eu fosse?"

#: search:search_7860D620_E190_48D4_80A9_0805BEAEAB0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd09fdb1d3d517fa02231c8751f1c538ac1ed85d0099ea0bcf618d22d2dbb9d6
#. default-sha256: 09defc9b277752f555b3d4ac597ea3a418b5f97bebee7436399a4bf16d69a2b1
msgctxt "search:search_7860D620_E190_48D4_80A9_0805BEAEAB0E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Saying this, the Maid took ⟪k:1⟫Your⟪k:2⟫the Departed’s⟪k:3⟫ hand.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It was cold "
"enough to send a shudder down ⟪k:6⟫Your⟪k:7⟫his⟪k:8⟫ spine—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫and completely devoid "
"of life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dizendo isso, a Criada pegou ⟪k:1⟫Sua⟪k:2⟫sua⟪k:3⟫ mão.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Estava fria o suficiente "
"para enviar um arrepio pela ⟪k:6⟫Sua⟪k:7⟫ ⟪k:8⟫ espinha—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫e completamente "
"desprovida de vida."

#: search:search_878F0081_8437_4841_BF7E_8563EAA5D849
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85bea1aed6ba35a6d8d9ece341399ec16b5704df13ca111c87ea51b4ee9be5a0
#. default-sha256: d81044ae58e49cdea56b77a4b19b7ae8fae8a4f0cf9b96ca6f7ce2cebd01e206
msgctxt "search:search_878F0081_8437_4841_BF7E_8563EAA5D849"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though, as chilling as it may have been,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You⟪k:3⟫he⟪k:4⟫ still took comfort in the "
"feeling of her hand in ⟪k:5⟫Yours⟪k:6⟫his⟪k:7⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora, por mais arrepiante que possa ter sido,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você⟪k:3⟫ele⟪k:4⟫ ainda sentiu "
"conforto com a sensação da mão dela na ⟪k:5⟫Sua⟪k:6⟫sua⟪k:7⟫."

