msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The Maid looked down at ⟪k:2⟫You⟪k:3⟫the Departed⟪k:4⟫ with gentle eyes.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫After "
"a few moments of silence, she sat down beside ⟪k:7⟫You⟪k:8⟫him⟪k:9⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A Criada olhou para ⟪k:2⟫Você⟪k:3⟫o Falecido⟪k:4⟫ com olhos gentis.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Após "
"alguns momentos de silêncio, ela se sentou ao ⟪k:7⟫Seu lado⟪k:8⟫lado dele⟪k:9⟫.⟪k:10⟫"

